## Features and enhancements
* Added a balanced query planner ([#5501](https://github.com/grafana/pyroscope/pull/5501)).
* Added symbol-ref tree support across the read path: a new `symbolref` model package, production and aggregation in symdb and the query backend, and resolution in the frontend after the final merge ([#5321](https://github.com/grafana/pyroscope/pull/5321), [#5322](https://github.com/grafana/pyroscope/pull/5322), [#5334](https://github.com/grafana/pyroscope/pull/5334)).
* Made experimental asynchronous queries resumable ([#5442](https://github.com/grafana/pyroscope/pull/5442)).
* Allowed compaction to read block metadata from object storage, adding the `metadata_source` and `metadata_fetch_timeout` options ([#5427](https://github.com/grafana/pyroscope/pull/5427)).
* Improved debuginfod client resilience and observability in the symbolizer, adding the `resolve_timeout` option ([#5449](https://github.com/grafana/pyroscope/pull/5449)).
* Added SDK scope usage tracking to the distributor ([#5366](https://github.com/grafana/pyroscope/pull/5366)).
* Added `replay dump` and `replay push` commands to `profilecli` ([#5374](https://github.com/grafana/pyroscope/pull/5374)).
* Improved read-path performance by optimizing the index symbol cache layout and aligning the symdb sample appender ([#5534](https://github.com/grafana/pyroscope/pull/5534), [#5535](https://github.com/grafana/pyroscope/pull/5535)).
* Improved metastore and compaction performance by scanning block bounds before decoding and avoiding deep label clones when building block indexes ([#5407](https://github.com/grafana/pyroscope/pull/5407), [#5398](https://github.com/grafana/pyroscope/pull/5398)).
* Reduced allocations in timeseries build and merge ([#5311](https://github.com/grafana/pyroscope/pull/5311)).

## Bug fixes
* Stopped a single bad DLQ object from blocking metastore recovery ([#5371](https://github.com/grafana/pyroscope/pull/5371)).
* Disabled raft pipeline replication in the metastore ([#5518](https://github.com/grafana/pyroscope/pull/5518)).
* Fixed a double prefix on metastore index cache and DLQ metrics ([#5543](https://github.com/grafana/pyroscope/pull/5543)).
* Allowed the segment writer shard shuffle table to grow past 4096 entries ([#5519](https://github.com/grafana/pyroscope/pull/5519)).
* Served profile-type Series queries from metadata when the selector is empty ([#5483](https://github.com/grafana/pyroscope/pull/5483)).
* Used `raft_log.CompactionJobStatusUpdate` instead of `metastorev1.CompactionJobStatusUpdate` in compaction ([#5465](https://github.com/grafana/pyroscope/pull/5465)).
* Keyed adaptive placement distribution stats by tenant and dataset ([#5450](https://github.com/grafana/pyroscope/pull/5450)).
* Collapsed stripped profiles to a single sample in the distributor ([#5409](https://github.com/grafana/pyroscope/pull/5409)).
* Treated a JFR profile size limit of 0 as unlimited ([#5502](https://github.com/grafana/pyroscope/pull/5502)).
* Excluded the pre-window boundary point from `profilecli` query top totals ([#5359](https://github.com/grafana/pyroscope/pull/5359)).
* Pointed v2 dashboard event annotations at the Alloy events stream ([#5499](https://github.com/grafana/pyroscope/pull/5499)).
* Fixed the missing namespace in Helm discovery RBAC objects ([#5447](https://github.com/grafana/pyroscope/pull/5447)).

## Security updates
* Updated Go to 1.25.13 ([#5520](https://github.com/grafana/pyroscope/pull/5520)).
* Updated `go.etcd.io/etcd/client/pkg/v3` to v3.6.14 ([#5526](https://github.com/grafana/pyroscope/pull/5526)).
* Updated `golang.org/x/mod` to v0.40.0 ([#5521](https://github.com/grafana/pyroscope/pull/5521)).
* Bumped `nanoid` to 3.3.18 in the UI ([#5522](https://github.com/grafana/pyroscope/pull/5522)).
* This release also includes every security fix from 2.2.1.

## Documentation updates
* Added Node.js to the source code integration docs ([#5490](https://github.com/grafana/pyroscope/pull/5490)).
* Documented Python memory profiling ([#5406](https://github.com/grafana/pyroscope/pull/5406)).
* Clarified contributing build targets and the `ui/dist` requirement ([#5457](https://github.com/grafana/pyroscope/pull/5457)).

